(1) Yann Tal, "Computing Modular Factorials Below the Square-Root Barrier", ECCC TR26-211 (Sept 2026), https://eccc.weizmann.ac.il/report/2026/211/ . (2) Bostan–Gaudry–Schost 2007 SIAM J. Comput., https://mathexp.eu/bostan/publications/BoGaSc07.pdf . (3) Harvey arXiv 2010.05450 and Harvey–Hittmeir arXiv 2105.11105.

